WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
Okay, now start talking to me nicely

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,800
If anyone talks nonsense, get out of here

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,680
Then start from the first person

4
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:12,870
Then please come in, Vice Captain

5
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,950
Why are you interested in visiting here today?

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,940
Mr. Zhang, I came with a mission.

7
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,610
What mission did General Shen give you?

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:27,950
Come to prepare a group of soldiers for General Shen.

9
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,850
I remember that General Shen's personal guards were always doing well.

10
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,820
Why are we suddenly recruiting people?

11
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,940
Because the tutor will be transferred soon

12
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:37,900
Will take some people away

13
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,820
So this is to prepare in advance

14
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:46,440
Why were you suddenly transferred? Could it be that you made a breakthrough?

15
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:48,690
Leg breakthrough not long ago

16
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:51,730
Late congenital condition at the age of twenty-three

17
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,960
No wonder his master was transferred

18
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,200
This is obviously making way for yourself.

19
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,080
Everything is dominated by General Shen

20
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:00,480
Captain Qi, you choose first among this group of people.

21
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,600
Twenty-three days of congenital late stage

22
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,480
I will definitely become a Grandmaster Police Officer in the future.

23
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,640
You might even get a glimpse of the Grandmaster

24
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:09,670
There is no harm in being friends with such a person
